  "statement": "\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf \u003cimg width\u003d\"41\" height\u003d\"41\" src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_1_1_operations,expressions,andvariables_9_1/image012.gif\" class\u003d\"middle\"\u003e and \u003cimg width\u003d\"53\" height\u003d\"41\" src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_1_1_operations,expressions,andvariables_9_1/image013.gif\" class\u003d\"middle\"\u003e, use your calculator to evaluate the expression\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ci\u003exy\u003c/i\u003e + \u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e + \u003ci\u003ey\u003c/i\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
